# S17: Agent Memory

## Objective

Give agents persistent memory across chats. ROOT remembers project goals, past
epics, and user preferences. PLANNER remembers successful decomposition patterns.
This prevents ROOT from proposing duplicate epics and makes the orchestrator feel
like a real collaborator rather than a stateless service.

## Prerequisites

- S16 CLOSED (LLM chat loop working)
- `wc_agents` table exists; agent context pipeline in `llm/context.ts`

## Data model

New table `wc_agent_memory`:
```sql
wc_agent_memory(
  id pk,
  scope_type TEXT,    -- 'project' | 'chat' | 'board'
  scope_id TEXT,
  role TEXT,          -- agent role
  key TEXT,           -- e.g. 'goals', 'patterns', 'user_prefs'
  value JSON,         -- arbitrary structured memory
  ts TIMESTAMPTZ
)
```

